{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 美國 Black Friday 減價進入最後階段，Apple 多條產品線同步降價，由 AirPods Pro 3、AirTag 2 到 iPad、Apple Watch、MacBook 與 Mac mini 都有折扣。以下整合 10 款熱門型號的現價、原價與減幅，一次看清哪款值得入手。價格隨時浮動，落單前請以 Amazon 頁面顯示為準。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Apple Logo Top Half\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Logo-Top-Half-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure><table><thead><tr><th>產品</th><th>現價</th><th>原價</th><th>減幅</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AirPods Pro 3</td><td>US$149</td><td>US$249</td><td>40%</td></tr><tr><td>AirTag 2（四個裝）</td><td>US$79</td><td>US$99</td><td>20%</td></tr><tr><td>iPad mini (A20 Pro) 128GB</td><td>US$599</td><td>US$699</td><td>14%</td></tr><tr><td>iPad Air (M4) 11 吋 128GB</td><td>US$649</td><td>US$749</td><td>13%</td></tr><tr><td>iPad Air (M4) 13 吋 128GB</td><td>US$849</td><td>US$949</td><td>11%</td></tr><tr><td>iPad 11 (A16) 128GB</td><td>US$379</td><td>US$449</td><td>16%</td></tr><tr><td>Apple Watch Series 12 42mm</td><td>US$299</td><td>US$399</td><td>25%</td></tr><tr><td>Apple Watch Series 12 46mm</td><td>US$349</td><td>US$449</td><td>22%</td></tr><tr><td>MacBook Air (M5) 13 吋 512GB</td><td>US$999</td><td>US$1,299</td><td>23%</td></tr><tr><td>MacBook Air (M5) 15 吋 512GB</td><td>US$1,199</td><td>US$1,499</td><td>20%</td></tr><tr><td>MacBook Pro 16 吋 (M5 Pro) 1TB</td><td>US$3,099</td><td>US$3,399</td><td>9%</td></tr><tr><td>Mac mini (M6) 256GB</td><td>US$779</td><td>US$899</td><td>13%</td></tr><tr><td>Mac mini (M6) 512GB</td><td>US$949</td><td>US$1,099</td><td>14%</td></tr><tr><td>MacBook Neo (A18 Pro) 256GB</td><td>US$599.99</td><td>US$699</td><td>14%</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h2>AirPods Pro 3　US$149</h2>\n<p>AirPods Pro 3 現價 US$149，較原價 US$249 減 40%，是這批優惠中減幅最大的一款。新一代聲學架構令主動降噪效能比上代提升約一倍，同時內置心率感測，支援 50 種運動模式；配合 Apple Intelligence 可使用即時翻譯、聽力測試與助聽器功能，充電盒改用 USB-C。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Airpods Pro 3 In Case\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"512\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Airpods-Pro-3-In-Case-1024x512.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple AirPods Pro 3 Wireless Earbuds with Active Noise Cancellation | Live Translation, Heart Rate Sensing, Hearing Aid Feature, Bluetooth Headphones, Spatial Audio, USB-C Charging\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/218Mmzk0EaL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple AirPods Pro 3 Wireless Earbuds with Active Noise Cancellation | Live Translation, Heart Rate Sensing, Hearing Aid Feature, Bluetooth Headphones, Spatial Audio, USB-C Charging</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$149.00</p>\n<p>$249.00</p>\n<p>-40%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>AirTag 2　四個裝 US$79</h2>\n<p>AirTag 2 四個裝減至 US$79，原價 US$99，減 20%，平均每個約 US$19.75；單個裝同步減至 US$18，原價 US$29，減 38%。第二代超寬頻晶片令精確尋找範圍提升約 50%，喇叭音量亦加大約 50%，並支援在 Apple Watch 上直接看到方向指引。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"airtag2 main\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"622\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/airtag2-main.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple AirTag (2nd Generation) - 4 Pack: Tracker for Keychain, Wallet, and More; Locator with Sound; Simple One-Tap Setup with iPhone or iPad; Key Finder with up to 1.5X Precision Finding Range*\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31l2rVm48QL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple AirTag (2nd Generation) - 4 Pack: Tracker for Keychain, Wallet, and More; Locator with Sound; Simple One-Tap Setup with iPhone or iPad; Key Finder with up to 1.5X Precision Finding Range*</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$79.00</p>\n<p>$99.00</p>\n<p>-20%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>iPad mini (A20 Pro)　US$599</h2>\n<p>iPad mini (A20 Pro) 128GB Wi-Fi 版售 US$599，原價 US$699，減 14%，屬新機首度明顯降價。8.5 吋 Super Retina XDR OLED 屏幕是今代最大改動，對比與色彩較上代 LCD 明顯提升；A20 Pro 晶片內置 16 核心神經網絡引擎，主打 Apple Intelligence 與新 Siri，前置 12MP 相機支援 Center Stage。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"ipadmini a17pro\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ipadmini-a17pro-1024x436.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HPC1JLCQ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad mini (A20 Pro) — Midnight | 8.5-inch OLED Display, 128GB, Wi-Fi 7, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Water Resistant\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Er2f+KkhL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HPC1JLCQ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad mini (A20 Pro) — Midnight | 8.5-inch OLED Display, 128GB, Wi-Fi 7, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Water Resistant</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$599.00</p>\n<p>$699.00</p>\n<p>-14%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HPC1JLCQ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>iPad Air (M4)　兩個尺寸同減 US$100</h2>\n<p>iPad Air (M4) 11 吋 128GB 售 US$649，原價 US$749，減 13%；13 吋 128GB 售 US$849，原價 US$949，減 11%。兩款均配 M4 晶片與 Liquid Retina 屏幕，兼容 Apple Pencil Pro 及 Magic Keyboard，適合文書、剪片與 AI 任務。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"ipadair M4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"553\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ipadair-M4-1024x553.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVBJT4J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad Air 11-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Blue\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MceeejQwL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVBJT4J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad Air 11-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Blue</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$649.00</p>\n<p>$749.00</p>\n<p>-13%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVBJT4J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVLJGJH?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad Air 13-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419ufaFWSEL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVLJGJH?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad Air 13-inch (M4): Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, 12MP Front/Back Camera, Wi-Fi 7 with Apple N1, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Space Gray</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$849.00</p>\n<p>$949.00</p>\n<p>-11%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GQVLJGJH?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>iPad 11 (A16)　US$379</h2>\n<p>入門級 iPad 11 (A16) 128GB 售 US$379，原價 US$449，減 16%，是全文最平的平板。11 吋 Liquid Retina 屏幕支援 True Tone，A16 晶片應付日常多工、遊戲與輕度剪輯足夠，Touch ID 設於頂部電源鍵，兼容 Apple Pencil (USB-C) 與 Magic Keyboard Folio。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【網購優惠】iPad 11 (A16)　降價 16%　入手好時機\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/iPad-11-Overview-Brh97xhhd8b6-Og-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZ75TN5F?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple iPad 11-inch: A16 chip, 11-inch Model, Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, Wi-Fi 6, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Blue\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TwHPMMl-L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZ75TN5F?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple iPad 11-inch: A16 chip, 11-inch Model, Liquid Retina Display, 128GB, Wi-Fi 6, 12MP Front/12MP Back Camera, Touch ID, All-Day Battery Life — Blue</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$379.00</p>\n<p>$449.00</p>\n<p>-16%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZ75TN5F?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>Apple Watch Series 12　42mm US$299</h2>\n<p>Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 版 42mm 減至 US$299，原價 US$399，減 25%；46mm 減至 US$349，原價 US$449，減 22%。今代升級心率感應，可每 5 分鐘量度 HRV，配合睡眠分數與 Readiness 評估恢復狀況；鋁金屬錶殼改用 Ceramic Shield 2，正常使用續航約 24 小時。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 Ep17epp8v16q Og 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Watch-Series-12-Ep17epp8v16q-Og-1-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJB63G4M?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 42mm Smartwatch | Dark Bronze Aluminum Case, Olive Sport Band - S/M. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rpFO46CeL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJB63G4M?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 42mm Smartwatch | Dark Bronze Aluminum Case, Olive Sport Band - S/M. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$299.00</p>\n<p>$399.00</p>\n<p>-25%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJB63G4M?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 46mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - M/L. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TDCgQg33L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 46mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - M/L. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$349.00</p>\n<p>$449.00</p>\n<p>-22%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>MacBook Air (M5)　13 吋 US$999</h2>\n<p>MacBook Air 13 吋（M5）16GB / 512GB 售 US$999，原價 US$1,299，減 23%，是今次 Mac 系列減幅最大的一款；15 吋同容量售 US$1,199，原價 US$1,499，減 20%。M5 晶片配合 16GB 統一記憶體，官方標示最長 18 小時續航，支援 Wi-Fi 7 與兩個外接顯示器。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"macbookair\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"468\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/macbookair-1024x468.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1JTFP8?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 MacBook Air 13-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 13.6-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 512GB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZqZQY3BjL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1JTFP8?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 MacBook Air 13-inch Laptop with M5 chip: Built for AI, 13.6-inch Liquid Retina Display, 16GB Unified Memory, 512GB SSD, 12MP Center Stage Camera, Touch ID, Wi-Fi 7; Midnight</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$999.00</p>\n<p>$1,299.00</p>\n<p>-23%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR1JTFP8?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>MacBook Pro 16 吋 (M5 Pro)　US$3,099</h2>\n<p>MacBook Pro 16 吋 PROLED XDR（M5 Pro）24GB / 1TB 售 US$3,099，原價 US$3,399，減 9%。這款屬今代高階型號，主打 PROLED XDR 觸控屏幕與 M5 Pro 的 18 核心 CPU、20 核心 GPU 組合，適合剪輯、3D 與本地 AI 運算；以高階機而言折扣不算大，但已是近期少見的減價。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"M5 Macbookpro 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"637\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/M5-Macbookpro-1-1024x637.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HPM9B9Q4?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 MacBook Pro with 16.3-inch PROLED XDR Display - Silver | M5 Pro chip with 18-core CPU and 20-core GPU: Touch, a powerful platform for AI, 24GB Unified Memory, 1TB Storage\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31cSPQ2GJIL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HPM9B9Q4?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 MacBook Pro with 16.3-inch PROLED XDR Display - Silver | M5 Pro chip with 18-core CPU and 20-core GPU: Touch, a powerful platform for AI, 24GB Unified Memory, 1TB Storage</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$3,099.00</p>\n<p>$3,399.00</p>\n<p>-9%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HPM9B9Q4?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>Mac mini (M6)　US$779</h2>\n<p>Mac mini (M6) 16GB / 256GB 售 US$779，原價 US$899，減 13%；512GB 版售 US$949，原價 US$1,099，減 14%。M6 晶片採 12 核心 CPU 與 12 核心 GPU，全系列標配 2.5Gb Ethernet，並支援 Wi-Fi 7 與藍牙 6，仍是體驗 macOS 最便宜的入門做法。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"m6 macmini2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/m6-macmini2-1024x576.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HGGJZ92H?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 Mac mini desktop computer M6 chip | 12‑core CPU and 12‑core GPU, 16GB Unified Memory, 256GB SSD Storage\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11dTI-4+epL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HGGJZ92H?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 Mac mini desktop computer M6 chip | 12‑core CPU and 12‑core GPU, 16GB Unified Memory, 256GB SSD Storage</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$779.00</p>\n<p>$899.00</p>\n<p>-13%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HGGJZ92H?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>MacBook Neo　US$599.99</h2>\n<p>MacBook Neo 13 吋（A18 Pro）8GB / 256GB 售 US$599.99，原價 US$699，減 14%。這款定位入門，用 A18 Pro 晶片而非 M 系，配 Liquid Retina 屏幕與 1080p FaceTime HD 相機，適合上網、文書與串流；以 US$600 以下入手一部全新 Mac 筆電，是今次 Black Friday 的另一個焦點。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Macbookneo 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"583\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Macbookneo-1-1024x583.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR6BVYS5?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple 2026 MacBook Neo 13-inch Laptop with A18 Pro chip: Built for AI and Apple Intelligence, Liquid Retina Display, 8GB Unified Memory, 256GB SSD Storage, 1080p FaceTime HD Camera; Citrus\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ANfI7MTSL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR6BVYS5?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple 2026 MacBook Neo 13-inch Laptop with A18 Pro chip: Built for AI and Apple Intelligence, Liquid Retina Display, 8GB Unified Memory, 256GB SSD Storage, 1080p FaceTime HD Camera; Citrus</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$599.99</p>\n<p>$699.00</p>\n<p>-14%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GR6BVYS5?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>以上產品屬美國 Amazon 限定出貨。若帳號設定的是本地收貨地址，頁面有機會只顯示「沒有供應」，或價格下方不提供送貨選項；只要在帳號加入 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a> 並設為預設收貨地址，價錢與送貨安排就會正常顯示。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\"/></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>Apple 產品一般提供全球維修，保養問題不大，但各地 Apple Store 做法可能有差異。若在美國購買 AppleCare+，意外損壞換機須在原購買地處理，不能在香港或台灣要求意外更換。Amazon 各產品頁亦同時提供 AppleCare+ 加購，下單前可先比較保障年期與價錢。</p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:57.340054+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":5388,"images":24,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:57:56.471168+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:32.052374+00:00","content_hash":"bddf4ae93126e8c079a2e5ddcad6fc4d4d670c6629f486a89e7f0b39c58880b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}